WEBVTT

00:00:00.288 --> 00:00:03.998
Supplier raised prices? Change the price <b>from the register</b>

00:00:04.049 --> 00:00:07.600
Open the product details

00:00:07.648 --> 00:00:09.759
Tap <b>Actualizar precio</b> (update price)

00:00:09.833 --> 00:00:12.983
The cashier needs the administrator's PIN

00:00:13.027 --> 00:00:16.669
Type the new price and save

00:00:16.731 --> 00:00:20.121
From now on it rings up at the new price
